#lang turmeric
;; The Turmeric spelling of each line of scheme.tur.  A `.` symbol is what a
;; dotted pair reads as (the reader validates the shape under Scheme and
;; keeps the marker), `~`/`~@` are Turmeric's unquotes, `[...]` is the vector,
;; and `#u8(...)` reads as the `(bytevector ...)` call form.
(a . b)
(a b . c)
'(1 . 2)
`(1 ~x ~@ys)
[1 2 3]
(bytevector 1 2 3)
foo
aAb
(hello world MiXed)
(HELLO)
(5 -5 0.5 -0.5 -31 2 3.0 16)
"aAb|c"
(f true false true false)
'()
(r7rs-char__ 65)
(kept) (also kept)
